@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = PASTE_A_LOGIN_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Web to phone: create a one-time code (signed in)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/handoff
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Web to phone: redeem the code (no login)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/handoff/redeem
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "PASTE_CODE_FROM_STEP_1"
}

### 3. Phone to web: start a request (no login)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/handoff/request

### 4. Phone to web: poll the request
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/handoff/request/PASTE_REQUEST_ID_FROM_STEP_3

### 5. Phone to web: see who is asking (signed in)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/handoff/inspect
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_code": "PASTE_USER_CODE_FROM_STEP_3"
}

### 6. Phone to web: approve (set approve to false to deny)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/handoff/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_code": "PASTE_USER_CODE_FROM_STEP_3",
  "approve": true
}
